    "_note": "Categorical series for chart-like widgets (math templates). Deliberately outside the brand ramps: Lively is a warm muted palette and cannot yield 5 discriminable categorical hues — every 4-hue combination drawn from green/sun/clay/lagoon fails CVD and normal-vision separation on the dark surface. Both rows below pass the full validator (lightness, chroma, CVD, normal-vision, contrast) against their own surface; the dark row is selected, not an automatic flip. Status colours (success/danger/warning) stay reserved for feedback and are never a series slot.",
